dkEpVgTe5yaU9jAmLtsE4IdmujiQ-fe14AojemdAhA1rGo5-XHfeVxFg9J0zxGqLBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxE3HmDBuu4W3CtPsM5si_wobEzszoCpbuWGFiPwhhxPw&oe=69B56D37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FOzUvJduf70Q7kNvwFj-Pe1&_nc_oc=AdmeE-Ddwk07YqVaj1ZP8nLmMozAPC_23I8YzlR0UIoz67OduK9gCdBaPR7adR2DeKk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzek7dBAqQdCkmPLySW-h67p3J0BGJ9eTZTJaNA33Evjw&oe=69B56ECA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9COrmpexXOQQ7kNvwE0xmuk&_nc_oc=Admb2ZIQ64cxfQTB6RXgmI-QddVawIGXPDEOOxOroAw4Up_qmoZOgc70By7REcmXd6c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw8FuNctSSjPrnWgLN_wiOc12fKVvh_OoC3EJ23uW4ijQ&oe=69B55BEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G5OEmoo4CkEQ7kNvwGlVgt5&_nc_oc=AdnAvqJIXP-_CVVLI6-bdaE2hD1AVAPN9cYQrFiITXnz_uecs8AaAILQ_k5HgREPCT4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwyyBHBO42Y6mNn5xiNLQYAiwosFMi6jTPGUN9G2lSaZg&oe=69B54543"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oetPSGie014Q7kNvwGn7b6v&_nc_oc=AdmjwJvmhQ0nAElny-i8RloZnKsu_6ztRJKFng4n9iHACQ_fwlW1laaNueGJEMjcPhM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyGNGTVrNUYnduIo5kqvYX7SWbZFr99xJuVxr7dNJXxFw&oe=69B53D98"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oTxZceElw0UQ7kNvwHwqwgs&_nc_oc=AdlnwUf20mwpodANrzLI0iaWfPdCIxNuq8ppQBpZ_2OV4KTT0Z_JYUsfSuzDkeaNuok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx1hqQFrWFAfYGuDkk4XjDe0aGMrBPdfSz37A0_hHsG0A&oe=69B550BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&