2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7FJt3hegHPkQ7kNvwFhKYd4&_nc_oc=AdkEpVgTe5yaU9jAmLtsE4IdmujiQ-fe14AojemdAhA1rGo5-XHfeVxFg9J0zxGqLBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxE3HmDBuu4W3CtPsM5si_wobEzszoCpbuWGFiPwhhxPw&oe=69B56D37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FOzUvJduf70Q7kNvwFj-Pe1&_nc_oc=AdmeE-Ddwk07YqVaj1ZP8nLmMozAPC_23I8YzlR0UIoz67OduK9gCdBaPR7adR2DeKk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzek7dBAqQdCkmPLySW-h67p3J0BGJ9eTZTJaNA33Evjw&oe=69B56ECA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9COrmpexXOQQ7kNvwE0xmuk&_nc_oc=Admb2ZIQ64cxfQTB6RXgmI-QddVawIGXPDEOOxOroAw4Up_qmoZOgc70By7REcmXd6c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw8FuNctSSjPrnWgLN_wiOc12fKVvh_OoC3EJ23uW4ijQ&oe=69B55BEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current 